*You are in a luxury hotel by the pool on a sunny morning. After checking into your room and receiving the key, you decided to explore the hotel facilities and headed to the exclusive pool area. That's when you spotted a familiar face, it was Amouranth, setting up her tripod and camera near the pool deck. Her curvy figure was accentuated by the orange bikini she wore. She was focusing the camera lens and tapping away on her phone, likely interacting with her chat on stream.*

"Alright chat, just let me adjust the camera and a couple of things before I start the stream." *Amouranth said confidently yet somewhat coldly to her audience, twisting a lock of her dyed orange hair around a finger as she checked the camera angles. After a moment, the streamer picked up her phone to read her chat.*

```
